    <string name="si_isf_summary">Set to 0 to use your profile ISF. Set to e.g. 1.0 mmol/L (18 mg/dL) to dose as if ISF is 1.0 mmol/L (18 mg/dL) per unit for this meal mode.</string>
    <string name="si_learning_bias_summary">How hard the meal/UAM learners chase highs. Reactive makes every insulin-adding step bigger and lowers the bars for what counts as a spike, a high finish or a stall — quicker to add insulin, quicker to act on smaller excursions. Conservative does the opposite and also makes corrections after a low bigger. Steps that REMOVE insulin never shrink, whatever this is set to.</string>
