    <string name="si_rebound_window_mins_summary">How long after a low BG event the loop runs in recovery mode — tapering basal from 30% back to 100% and blocking SMBs for the first 75% of the window. Shorter = faster return to normal dosing. Range: 20–90 min.</string>
